{"id": "65294", "title": "现在，很想见你", "author": "Fatina", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 3, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/65/65294.htm", "intro": "本书简介：\r\n\r\n男主：棠玮  女主：若蝶\r\n\r\n\r\n是一篇有关於好朋友的故事\r\n\r\n原本是好朋友的两人\r\n\r\n因为男主角要娶了别人\r\n\r\n改变了...\r\n\r\nPS：男女主角原来是好朋友，后来发展成为男女朋友。", "base": "files/article/html/65/65294", "chapters": [{"title": "1", "file": "9722375.html", "available": false}, {"title": "2", "file": "9722377.html", "available": false}, {"title": "完结", "file": "9722383.html", "available": false}]}